# Correct fork/join with parallel narration, revealed in three steps. Expected: pass.
diagram activity
id onboarding
title A new hire's laptop and badge are prepared at the same time
desc Activity diagram. Start, accept offer, then a fork: order laptop and print badge run at the same time. A join waits for both, then first day, then end.
narration After the offer is accepted, IT orders the laptop and security prints the badge at the same time.

start begin
action accept "accept offer"
begin -> accept

step 1
fork split
action laptop "order laptop"
action badge "print badge"
accept -> split
split -> laptop
split -> badge

step 2
join wait
action first "first day"
end done
laptop -> wait
badge -> wait
wait -> first
first -> done
